{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265vVKYKO0Sb1794380398.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產東涌藍天海岸分行經理王焌軒表示，本港租務市場持續活躍。分行新近促成東涌藍天海岸4期水藍‧天岸6座中層D室租賃成交，單位實用面積749平方呎，3房套房及梗廚間隔，向東北，享海景，月租叫價2.9萬元，以2.85萬元租出，實用呎租38元。<br/>王焌軒表示，租客為退休人士，鍾情水藍‧天岸伙數少相對清靜，加上單位享海景，故迅速決定承租。業主於2022年8月以980萬元買入單位，租金回報約3.5厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.771816+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:37.872541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:23.551320+00:00","content_hash":"92b83a13bece927916bbdd6611b47e8d23818241df44b8ea5e91353127f9b196","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.771816+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}